flowchart TB
  IN["One input box<br/>URL / address / several screenshots"]
  IN --> DUP{"Seen this<br/>before?"}
  DUP -- yes --> WARN["Say so plainly<br/>when you saw it, what it cost then<br/>whether you kept it or dropped it"]
  WARN --> CARD
  DUP -- no --> SCORE["Two measured scores<br/>safety and convenience<br/>price stays information"]
  SCORE --> CARD["Preview card<br/>both scores + rent + full breakdown<br/>a short note in your language"]
  CARD --> KEEP["Save to the list"]
  CARD --> DROP["Discard<br/>kept as rejected, so the dedupe<br/>can remind you next time"]
  KEEP --> LIST["The list<br/>sort by any column, click back to the map"]
  LIST --> REF["Refresh<br/>still up? has the rent moved?<br/>URL-sourced listings only"]
  REF --> DEAD["Gone means marked, never deleted<br/>the row stays as a benchmark"]
